{"seq":1,"slug":"data-quality-rules-validation","title":"商品数据质量规则与内容校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/data-quality-onboarding-stewardship/data-quality-rules-validation","wordCount":3125,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品数据质量规则与内容校验\">商品数据质量规则与内容校验</h1><p>同一款蓝牙耳机，供应商在 Excel 里写续航 30h，运营在场站填 32h，质检报告实测 28h。三个数字都不是笔误，问题是没有一条可执行的规则说清「哪个字段和哪个字段要对得上、以什么为权威」。商品数据质量（Product Data Quality, PDQ）处理的就是这类事：把「数据好不好」拆成一组<strong>可机器判定、可追责、可回归</strong>的校验规则，在录入、审核、下发渠道这条链路上逐层拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>数据质量规则（data quality rule）</strong> 是对某个属性或属性组合的一条谓词断言：输入一条商品记录，返回通过或违反，并附带严重度、责任方、消息码。它区别于「业务校验」（下单时校验库存）——数据质量规则关心的是<strong>主数据本身是否可信</strong>，而非某次交易能否成立。</p>\n<p>行业把「好坏」拆成若干正交维度，最常被引用的是 DAMA-DMBOK 六维模型与 ISO 8000 系列（ISO 8000-110 定义主数据交换的质量要求）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>商品数据例子</th>\n<th>可机器判定的程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整性 Completeness</td>\n<td>必填属性是否有值</td>\n<td>缺失「净重」「原产国」</td>\n<td>完全可判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性 Consistency</td>\n<td>跨系统/跨字段是否自洽</td>\n<td>PIM 与 ERP 品牌名不一致</td>\n<td>需跨源比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规性 Conformance</td>\n<td>是否符合 schema/受控词表</td>\n<td>颜色值不在枚举内</td>\n<td>完全可判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一性 Uniqueness</td>\n<td>标识是否重复</td>\n<td>两个 SKU 共用同一 GTIN</td>\n<td>需全局索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性 Accuracy</td>\n<td>是否与物理事实相符</td>\n<td>标称 30h vs 实测 28h</td>\n<td>需实测或权威源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效 Timeliness</td>\n<td>是否在有效期内</td>\n<td>认证证书过期</td>\n<td>需日期字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键认知：<strong>六个维度里只有前四维的大部分能靠规则自动拦住</strong>，准确性必须靠实测数据或权威源（如供应商签署的合规声明、第三方检测报告）注入。因此 PDQ 的工程重心不是「消灭所有缺陷」，而是<strong>把缺陷拦在它最便宜的位置</strong>——录入端拦一条缺失的成本，远低于下发到 Amazon 后被下架的成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[供应商录入&lt;br/&gt;Excel / API / 门户] --&gt; B[字段级校验&lt;br/&gt;格式 枚举 必填]&#10;  B --&gt; C[记录级校验&lt;br/&gt;跨字段条件依赖]&#10;  C --&gt; D[跨记录校验&lt;br/&gt;GTIN 唯一 变体一致]&#10;  D --&gt; E[合规校验&lt;br/&gt;法规与平台政策]&#10;  E --&gt; F{严重度判定}&#10;  F --&gt;|error| G[退回录入&lt;br/&gt;缺陷队列]&#10;  F --&gt;|warn / pass| H[人工审核&lt;br/&gt;四眼审批]&#10;  H --&gt; I[发布渠道副本]&#10;  I --&gt; J[渠道回执&lt;br/&gt;拒收/警告]&#10;  J --&gt; K[规则调优&lt;br/&gt;误杀与漏放回归]&#10;  K --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[供应商录入&lt;br/&gt;Excel / API / 门户] --&gt; B[字段级校验&lt;br/&gt;格式 枚举 必填]\n  B --&gt; C[记录级校验&lt;br/&gt;跨字段条件依赖]\n  C --&gt; D[跨记录校验&lt;br/&gt;GTIN 唯一 变体一致]\n  D --&gt; E[合规校验&lt;br/&gt;法规与平台政策]\n  E --&gt; F{严重度判定}\n  F --&gt;|error| G[退回录入&lt;br/&gt;缺陷队列]\n  F --&gt;|warn / pass| H[人工审核&lt;br/&gt;四眼审批]\n  H --&gt; I[发布渠道副本]\n  I --&gt; J[渠道回执&lt;br/&gt;拒收/警告]\n  J --&gt; K[规则调优&lt;br/&gt;误杀与漏放回归]\n  K --&gt; B</pre><p>层次的意义在于<strong>执行成本的递增</strong>：字段级校验是常数级字典查找，跨记录校验要跑全局索引，合规校验要读版本化法规库，渠道回执则异步滞后。把能在第一层杀掉的问题拖到最后一层，就是 PDQ 最常见的浪费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则分类与建模\">规则分类与建模</h2><p>规则不是一张平铺列表，而是分层的类型系统。工程上按「断言的作用域」和「断言的形态」两个轴切分。按作用域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>规则类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>执行代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段级</td>\n<td>必填 / 格式 / 枚举 / 范围</td>\n<td><code>gtin</code> 匹配 13/14 位且校验位正确</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录级</td>\n<td>条件必填 / 跨字段依赖</td>\n<td>品类为锂电池时 <code>un38_3_cert</code> 必填</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨记录级</td>\n<td>唯一性 / 变体一致性</td>\n<td>同变体组内各 SKU 的变体维度取值不重复</td>\n<td>需索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨源级</td>\n<td>一致性 / 血缘比对</td>\n<td>PIM 净重与 ERP 偏差 &gt; 5% 告警</td>\n<td>需 join</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策级</td>\n<td>平台 / 法规合规</td>\n<td>欧盟 GPSR 要求责任人信息</td>\n<td>需版本化规则库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按形态，规则引擎通常实现四种原语，其余规则都是它们的组合：<strong>断言（assertion）</strong> 是单字段谓词（正则、枚举、数值区间）；<strong>依赖（dependency）</strong> 是 <code>if A then B</code>，表达条件必填与条件枚举，是记录级校验的主力；<strong>集合约束（set constraint）</strong> 对一组记录施加（唯一性、单调性、覆盖度）；<strong>参考校验（referential check）</strong> 与外部权威源比对（GTIN 校验位、地址标准化、HS 编码合法性）。</p>\n<p><strong>表达方式</strong>是选型的分水岭。硬编码进应用的规则修改要发版，语义可配的规则库（JSON/YAML 规则包，或 SHACL、Schematron 这类约束语言方案）能让数据管家自己加规则。跨境场景尤其需要后者：不同目的国必填集不同、平台政策每季度变，绑在代码发版上必然滞后。规则的元数据字段不能省：<strong>rule_id</strong>（稳定标识，用于统计与豁免）、<strong>scope</strong>、<strong>severity</strong>（error/warn/info）、<strong>owner</strong>（缺陷归谁）、<strong>message</strong>（可读提示）、<strong>version</strong>（便于回归）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"完整性度量与阈值\">完整性度量与阈值</h2><p>「完整度 92%」这种数字如果不写清楚口径，就无法比较也无法改进。一个可复现的定义是 GS1 数据质量框架的思路：按属性权重加权，把「填了没」和「该不该填」分开。</p>\n<p>对某品类，其加权完整度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[v_i \\neq \\emptyset]}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.488em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是属性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的业务权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\cdot]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是指示函数。权重来自「缺了它会怎样」：缺失 GTIN 是 error（无法上架），缺失营销长描述是 warn（可先上架后补）。更贴近实际的版本是把<strong>合规性</strong>也纳入：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> 完整性</mtext></mrow></munder><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>conforms</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>K</mi><mtext> 合规性</mtext></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\left( \\underbrace{\\frac{\\sum w_i \\mathbb{1}[v_i \\neq \\emptyset]}{\\sum w_i}}_{C\\ \\text{完整性}},\\ \\underbrace{\\frac{\\sum w_i \\mathbb{1}[\\text{conforms}(v_i)]}{\\sum w_i}}_{K\\ \\text{合规性}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.9123em;vertical-align:-2.2623em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 4800\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3