pan><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.584em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.2623em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 4800\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,1209\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-1344c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 分别设阈值，才能区分「填了很多垃圾」和「填得少但都对」。跨渠道下发时平台对两者的敏感度不同：Amazon 的类目必填集直接决定 listing 能否创建（硬门），完整描述只影响转化率（软指标）。</p>\n<p>阈值不该拍脑袋，可用基线有三类：<strong>平台硬性要求</strong>（Amazon/Shopee 类目模板列出的 required 属性，缺失即创建失败）、<strong>竞争对手中位数</strong>（同类目前 20 名商品的平均属性覆盖）、<strong>自身历史分位</strong>（当前完整度的 P50 作回归基线）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[原始属性值] --&gt; B{属性权重}&#10;  B --&gt;|高 缺失即阻断| C[error 属性]&#10;  B --&gt;|中 缺失告警| D[warn 属性]&#10;  B --&gt;|低 可选| E[info 属性]&#10;  C --&gt; F[完整性 C 与合规性 K]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[按品类聚合 → 发布门禁]\">graph LR\n  A[原始属性值] --&gt; B{属性权重}\n  B --&gt;|高 缺失即阻断| C[error 属性]\n  B --&gt;|中 缺失告警| D[warn 属性]\n  B --&gt;|低 可选| E[info 属性]\n  C --&gt; F[完整性 C 与合规性 K]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[按品类聚合 → 发布门禁]</pre><h2 id=\"录入链路中的校验卡点\">录入链路中的校验卡点</h2><p>把规则放进流程，才有拦截力。跨境 PIM 的录入链路通常有五个卡点，每个卡点的规则强度与用户体验需要权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>卡点一：供应商录入端。</strong> 供应商通过门户或批量模板提交，此时做<strong>最严格的字段级校验</strong>并即时反馈。GS1 的 GDSN 网络就是这个模式的标准化版本：供应商发布到数据池（data pool），接收方（零售商）的校验规则在<strong>订阅时</strong>声明，不匹配的属性被拒绝并回执错误码。经验是<strong>错误消息必须可操作</strong>——「GTIN 校验位错误，第 13 位应为 X」远好于「数据无效」。</p>\n<p><strong>卡点二：内部审核队列。</strong> 机器挡不住的（跨源不一致、准确性存疑）进入人工审核队列，按严重度与品类权重排序，由数据管家处理。SLA 按业务影响分级：合规类缺陷 24 小时内清理，描述类可放宽到周级。</p>\n<p><strong>卡点三：四眼原则与发布门禁。</strong> 主数据变更采用 maker-checker：一人录入、另一人审批，高危属性（价格、合规声明）禁止单人闭环。发布门禁按品类配置——完整度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C &lt; 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 或存在 error 级缺陷时阻断下发。<strong>卡点四：渠道适配校验。</strong> 渠道要求的必填集、字数上限、图片规格、禁用词，规则来源应与主数据校验共用同一规则库，避免两套真相。</p>\n<p><strong>卡点五：渠道回执闭环。</strong> 渠道异步返回拒收或警告（类目不符、图片不合规），回执必须回灌成缺陷工单并关联原始记录，否则同类错误反复发生。回执也是<strong>规则调优信号</strong>：某规则误杀率高（大量被人工豁免），说明阈值或枚举设置错了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卡点</th>\n<th>主要规则类型</th>\n<th>反馈时延</th>\n<th>失败代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应商录入</td>\n<td>字段级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部审核</td>\n<td>跨源/准确性</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布门禁</td>\n<td>完整性/合规</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道适配</td>\n<td>政策级</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道回执</td>\n<td>政策级（异步）</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"法规与平台合规校验\">法规与平台合规校验</h2><p>跨境商品数据的合规校验有明确的<strong>外部权威源</strong>，规则必须版本化跟踪它们，否则会系统性滞后。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟</strong>：GPSR（通用产品安全法规 (EU) 2023/988，2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用）要求消费品线上销售时展示制造商/进口商信息与安全警示，CE 标志适用品类需技术文件与符合性声明（DoC），EPR 按国家与品类要求注册号。<strong>美国</strong>：CPSIA 要求儿童产品有 CPC 证书与追踪标签，加州 Prop 65 要求警示。<strong>电池</strong>：锂电池跨境运输需 UN 38.3 检测报告。</p>\n<p><strong>平台侧</strong>：Amazon 类目模板定义 required/optional 属性集与图片规格（主图纯白背景、最短边 1000px 触发放大）、A+ 内容禁用词；Shopee/Lazada 各有类目必填与本地化字段。这些是<strong>外部 schema</strong>，可编码为政策级规则：品类 → 目的市场 → 必填属性集 的三维查找。</p>\n<p>务实的做法是把法规/平台要求抽象成<strong>合规属性矩阵</strong>，用规则生成器从矩阵派生具体断言，法规更新时只改矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>policy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>required</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{policy}} = \\bigcup_{k \\in K} \\bigcup_{m \\in M} \\text{required}(k, m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">policy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">required</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是品类集合、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是目的市场集合。每个单元都可追溯到具体条文或平台文档，这是审计时唯一能自证的形态。<strong>平台政策与法规会变，本文时间点与条款应以下发当日的官方来源为准</strong>（欧盟官方公报、Amazon Seller Central 政策页、GS1 标准文档）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺陷管理与规则回归\">缺陷管理与规则回归</h2><p>规则跑起来会产出大量缺陷，治理的关键是<strong>不让缺陷变成噪音</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>缺陷分类与归因</strong>：每条缺陷带 rule_id 与 owner，按「责任方 × 品类 × 严重度」聚合，才能看出系统性问题——某供应商缺陷集中在「必填缺失」，问题是它的录入模板或培训。<strong>豁免与抑制</strong>：真实例外需<strong>有时效的豁免（waiver）</strong>，带到期日与批准人，而非永久静默。</p>\n<p><strong>误杀率与漏放率</strong>：规则质量用<strong>精确率与召回率</strong>衡量。误杀（规则报错但人工判合格）消耗管家时间、降低信任；漏放（规则放过但渠道拒收）代价最高。二者需分别统计并根据回执持续调参：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP},\\ R = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。规则库的<strong>回归测试</strong>不可省：把历史上被误判的样本固化为测试集，每次改规则跑一遍，防止调阈值时把老的误杀重新引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商品数据质量是把「好不好」拆成<strong>可机器判定、可追责、可回归</strong>的规则；DAMA-DMBOK 六维与 ISO 8000 提供词汇，但只有完整性、合规性、一致性的主体部分能自动拦住，准确性必须靠实测或权威源。</li>\n<li>规则按作用域分层（字段级 → 记录级 → 跨记录级 → 跨源级 → 政策级），执行成本逐层递增，<strong>缺陷应拦在它最便宜的位置</strong>。</li>\n<li>完整度用带权重的归一化公式定义，且要与合规性分开度量，才能区分「填了很多垃圾」与「填得少但都对」。</li>\n<li>录入链路的五个卡点（供应商录入、内部审核、发布门禁、渠道适配、渠道回执）各有其规则强度与失败代价，回执闭环是规则调优的关键信号。</li>\n<li>跨境合规校验必须跟踪 GPSR、CPSIA、UN 38.3、平台类目模板等外部权威源，并抽象成<strong>品类 × 市场</strong>的合规属性矩阵；具体条款与时间点以官方来源为准。</li>\n<li>缺陷按责任方聚合归因，豁免必须有时效，规则质量用精确率/召回率衡量，规则库需要回归测试集防止调参回退。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>规则写得再多，落到每条商品记录上也只有两件事：<strong>在正确的位置拦住它，或者放过去但记下为什么</strong>。前者靠分层校验，后者靠缺陷闭环与血缘——这也是本 hub 其余章节讨论的品类属性模型与跨渠道治理的公共底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>主数据与 Golden Record 建模：<code>../1_product-master-data-pim-model/1_product-master-data-golden-record.md</code></li>\n<li>品类与属性模型：<code>../2_taxonomy-attribute-variant-model/1_category-taxonomy-hierarchy-model.md</code></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品数据质量规则与内容校验","id":"商品数据质量规则与内容校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规则分类与建模","id":"规则分类与建模"},{"level":2,"text":"完整性度量与阈值","id":"完整性度量与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"录入链路中的校验卡点","id":"录入链路中的校验卡点"},{"level":2,"text":"法规与平台合规校验","id":"法规与平台合规校验"},{"level":2,"text":"缺陷管理与规则回归","id":"缺陷管理与规则回归"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"变体轴与 SKU 矩阵建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/taxonomy-attribute-variant-model/variant-axis-sku-matrix-model"},"next":{"title":"商品上新录入与 Onboarding 工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/data-quality-onboarding-stewardship/product-onboarding-intake-workflow"}}